        "owner": "src/pso/network/TLobby_804048E8.c",
        "detail": "The current compressed-frame owner uses PppFrame, the shared IPv4 header and allocator, and the typed shared PPP control declarations. The ARP owner uses the corresponding ArpState, including the packet pointer at 0x24. The native thread record, PPP receive bytes, and ARP record keep their original addresses. Both ARP callers pass a signed 16-bit iface socket to the word-sized dispatcher, so the current C provider retains its prototype.",
